msgid "Center on Start"
msgstr "Anfang in de Merrn"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:290 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:346
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:156
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Center the Gantt chart on the event start date and time"
msgstr "Anfangtiet un -datum na de Merrn vun't Gantt-Diagramm setten"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:293 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:349
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:159
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Click this button to center the Gantt chart on the start time and day of "
"this event."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du Anfangtiet un -datum vun't Gantt-Diagramm na "
"de Merrn setten wullt."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:300 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:356
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:166
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Pick Date"
msgstr "Datum utsöken"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:303 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:359
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:169
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Move the event to a date and time when all attendees are available"
msgstr ""
"Dat Begeefnis na en Datum un Tiet verschuven, wenn all Deelnehmers Tiet hebbt"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:307 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:363
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:173
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Click this button to move the event to a date and time when all the "
"attendees have time available in their Free/Busy lists."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du dat Begeefnis na en Datum un Tiet verschuven "
"wullt, wenn all Deelnehmers Tiet hebbt."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:315 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:371
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:181
msgctxt "@action:button reload freebusy data"
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Nieg laden"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:318 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:374
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:184
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Reload Free/Busy data for all attendees"
msgstr "De Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all Deelnehmers nieg laden"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:321 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:377
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:187
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Pressing this button will cause the Free/Busy data for all attendees to be "
"reloaded from their corresponding servers."
msgstr ""
"En Klick op dissen Knoop laadt de Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all "
"Deelnehmers nieg vun de tohören Servers."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:329 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:395
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:206
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows the Free/Busy status of all attendees"
msgstr "Wiest den Free-/Bunnen-Status vun all Deelnehmers"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:332 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:398
#: incidenceeditor-ng/visualfreebusywidget.cpp:209
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Shows the Free/Busy status of all attendees. Double-clicking on an "
"attendee's entry in the list will allow you to enter the location of their "
"Free/Busy Information."
msgstr ""
"Wiest de Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all Deelnehmers. Wenn Du op den "
"Listindrag vun en Deelnehmer dubbelklickst, kannst Du de Steed vun sien "
"Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen angeven."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:340
msgctxt "@title:column attendee name"
msgid "Attendee"
msgstr "Deelnehmer"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:590 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:668
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The meeting already has suitable start/end times."
msgstr "Disse Mööt hett al passen Anfang- un Enntieden."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:597 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:675
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"The next available time slot for the meeting is:<nl/>Start: %1<nl/>End: %"
"2<nl/>Would you like to move the meeting to this time slot?"
msgstr ""
"Dat neegst passen Tietfinster för de Mööt is:<nl/>Anfang: %1<nl/>Enn: %2<nl/"
">Wullt Du de Mööt na dissen Tietruum verschuven?"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:608 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:686
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "No suitable date found."
msgstr "Keen passen Datum funnen."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:746 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:817
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"Of the %1 participants, %2 have accepted, %3 have tentatively accepted, and %"
"4 have declined."
msgstr ""
"Vun de %1 Mitmakers hebbt %2 annahmen, %3 hebbt vörlöpig annahmen un %4 "
"hebbt afwiest."

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:840 editordetails.cpp:319
#: incidenceeditor-ng/incidenceattendee.cpp:173
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"%1 does not look like a valid email address. Are you sure you want to invite "
"this participant?"
msgstr ""
"As't lett is \"%1\" as Nettpostadress leeg. Büst Du seker, dat Du dissen "
"Deelnehmer inladen wullt?"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:843 incidenceeditor-ng/incidenceattendee.cpp:176
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Invalid Email Address"
msgstr "Leeg Nettpostadress"

#: editorfreebusy.cpp:1030 incidenceeditor-ng/editorfreebusy.cpp:1047
#: incidenceeditor-ng/incidenceattendee.cpp:469
msgctxt "@option"
msgid ""
"You are changing the organizer of this event. Since the organizer is also "
"attending this event, would you like to change the corresponding attendee as "
"well?"
msgstr ""
"Du wullt den Utrichter vun dit Begeefnis ännern. He nimmt dor ok an deel. "
"Wullt Du ok den tohören Deelnehmer ännern?"

